  "notes": [
    "**Caber** is completely irregular",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (quepo), otherwise regular -ER endings",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"cup-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"cab-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **cabido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"cabr-\" (not \"caber-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"cabr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Means \"to fit\" or \"to have enough room\"",
    "Common usage: *¿Cabe en la caja?* (Does it fit in the box?), *No quepo en el coche* (I don't fit in the car)",
    "Expression: *No cabe duda* (There's no doubt)",
    "Often used in 3rd person: *Cabe"
